@startuml
title Authenticated approval and explicit continuation
actor Human
participant Controller
participant "Existing AEO-1C CLI" as CLI
participant "WindowsConsoleHumanVerifier" as Verifier
database SQLite
Controller -> SQLite: persist exact scope and checkpoint
Controller --> Human: review package and supported approval command
Human -> CLI: approve-requirements / approve-design
CLI -> Verifier: confirm exact subject and authenticate
Verifier --> CLI: canonical authorized identity
CLI -> SQLite: decision and audit in one transaction
Human -> Controller: explicit resume by run ID
Controller -> SQLite: reload latest decision and scope
Controller -> Controller: verify identity, hashes, policy and limits
alt Valid unchanged authority
 Controller -> Controller: next permitted transition
else Missing / changed / revoked authority
 Controller -> SQLite: retain checkpoint and reason
end
@enduml
